# Helpers & Utilities

## Logger

```javascript
const { createLogger } = require("../helpers/logger.js")
const log = createLogger("my-module")
log.info("message", { key: "value" })  // structured meta
```

Levels: `LOG_LEVEL` env (default `info`). Files: `sevenbot.log`, `sevenbot-error.log`.

## Format (`helpers/format.js`)

Static methods on `Format` class — colors (`COL.HTB_GREEN`), markdown links, dates, unicode styling (`STL`).

## Helpers (`helpers/helpers.js`)

`H.sAcc(obj, ...keys)` safe nested access, `H.any(...)` random choice, `H.wait(ms)`, `H.maybe(prob)`.

## DialogFlow (`helpers/dflow.js`)

Syncs entity types (machines, challenges, members, flags) upstream/downstream. Special flag names extracted via `SevenDatastore.getDialogflowSpecialTargetFlagNames()` — handles array/object flag shapes.

## NLP (`helpers/nlp.js`, `modules/nlp/`)

`checkSelfName()`, typoify for human-like responses.

## Conventions

- Export pattern: `module.exports = { Format }` or `class` + named export
- JSDoc typedefs live in `models/api-classes.js`, domain classes in `helpers/classes.js`
- New helper functions: only if reused 3+ times; otherwise inline
